// Per-player physics cube: spawned by the server when a client joins, OWNED by that client. The
// owning client drives it with WASD/Space (key C toggles player control — the free-fly camera
// releases those keys), simulating it LOCALLY for full responsiveness; the claim stream carries the
// resulting body state to the server, validated by the Network/Validation plausibility gate (move
// implausibly fast or through geometry and the server rejects + force-corrects). Everyone else
// sees it as a normal replica.
Prefab netPlayerCube
	Scale 0.4
	Component Render
		ObjectContainer wireshapes
		Node Cube
		Type StaticMesh
	Component Physics
		Body Dynamic
		Shape Box
		HalfExtents 1 1 1
		Friction 0.4
		Restitution 0.05
		Density 300
		ContactEvents true
	Component Network
